UID:10020026-1794650400-1794657600@www.cmosc.org
SUMMARY:Healing with Play
DESCRIPTION:As part of Healing With Play\, children are invited to create a beautiful stained-glass-inspired butterfly in honor of someone they have lost. \n\n\n\nButterflies can represent transformation\, hope\, remembrance\, and the enduring nature of love. This gentle\, creative activity gives children a way to express their feelings\, remember a loved one\, and create something meaningful to carry with them.
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/healing-with-play/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.cmosc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/HealingWithPlay-TitleSlide.webp
END:VEVENT
