SUMMARY:Member Mornings
DESCRIPTION:We LOVE our members! On Sunday and Monday mornings members get exclusive access to the Museum for the first hour! \n\n\n\nAll Children’s Museum members enjoy these benefits:  \n\n\n\n\nFree admission during regular\, open days\n\n\n\nExclusive entrance to the museum during our Sunday Member Mornings \n\n\n\n$2.00 discounts on each admission for up to six additional guests \n\n\n\nDiscounted rates on Gift Corner purchases\, Private Playdates\, birthday parties\, and admission to select events \n\n\n\n$1.00 discounts on each admission for up to four persons to the Schulz Museum and Snoopy’s Home Ice Arena \n\n\n\n\nInterested in becoming a member? Check out our affordable Membership Levels here.
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/member-mornings-6/2026-11-15/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.cmosc.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/the_power_of_play_at_the_childrens_museum-37.webp
END:VEVENT
