SUMMARY:Circle Time with Alya
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Circle Time with Alya! \n\n\n\nThis engaging program for pre-kindergarten children features songs\, dancing\, and storytime with our very own Alya! \n\n\n\nChildren can prepare for pre-kindergarten by nurturing their literacy as well as social\, cognitive\, and emotional skills. \n\n\n\n📍The log circle in the Wild Zone | 📆 Mondays | ⏰2:00-2:30pm
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/circle-time-with-alya-3/2026-11-16/
CATEGORIES:Pre-K, K
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.cmosc.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/CMOSC_8-1-23_TWC-2962-copy-scaled.webp
END:VEVENT
